<%# The shape shared by every card of "My tables": a pointed arch of 220 x 310 px (ogive, application.css),
    its cover fading into the page at the bottom, and its outline drawn over it.
    The outline turns gold (brass) on the chosen card (aria-current) and on hover. Its color is a custom property
    (--ring) set on the card itself, which the path inherits: styling the path through a rule on its ancestor
    (group-aria-[current=true]:) left the old gold outline on screen for a while after another card was chosen.
    On hover the card rises smoothly, with a shadow: drop-shadow follows the drawn arch, a box shadow would be square.
    data: optional, for the table cards (game_tables_helper#table_card_data) %>
<%= link_to path, class: "relative block h-[310px] w-[220px] text-ink transition-[translate,filter] duration-300 ease-out [--ring:transparent] hover:-translate-y-2 hover:drop-shadow-xl hover:[--ring:var(--color-brass)] aria-[current=true]:[--ring:var(--color-brass)] motion-reduce:transition-none",
            aria: aria, data: local_assigns.fetch(:data, {}) do %>
  <span class="ogive absolute inset-0 isolate block bg-surface">
    <%= image_tag cover_image_path, alt: "", loading: "lazy", class: "absolute inset-0 -z-20 size-full object-cover" %>
    <span class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 block bg-linear-to-t from-page from-25% via-page/85 via-45% to-transparent to-70%"></span>
  </span>
  <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 size-full overflow-visible fill-none" viewBox="0 0 220 310" aria-hidden="true">
    <path class="stroke-line" d="<%= ogive_inner_path %>"></path>
    <path class="stroke-(--ring)" stroke-width="2" d="<%= ogive_outline_path %>"></path>
  </svg>
  <span class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex flex-col items-center gap-1 px-5 pt-4 pb-6 text-center">
    <%= yield %>
  </span>
<% end %>
